{"id":"u-450624b5-0f8f-4fa1-ad53-7df4426461e3","src":"community","title":"Mjolnir Method","author":"Lee Stitzel","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/KBEJbG-mjolnir-method","desc":"The purpose of the Mjölnir Method is to forge bench press dominance through structured, progressive overload across distinct training phases.\n\nThe program starts with a hypertrophy block to build muscle size and endurance, followed by a strength block to develop raw pressing power. A power block then transitions your gains into explosive force, culminating in a peak phase designed to unleash a new 1-rep max. \n\nDesigned as a complete, start-to-finish cycle, the Mjölnir Method can be run repeatedly for consistent progress, making it a powerful tool for long-term bench press success.\n\nWeeks 1-4 accumulate volume to stimulate hypertrophy. \nWeeks 5-8 builds a strength base, making use of your improved muscle size and endurance. \nWeeks 9-12 build power with your new strength and size with focus on rep maxes. \nWeeks 13-16 are a peak that build you up to a new one rep max.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-28T10:59:21.835Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60,"x":3},{"r":5,"pct":50,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60},{"r":10,"pct":50,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":64,"x":3},{"r"